    " ",
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        "Before selecting an elevator, builders should carefully evaluate the building\\'s purpose."
      ]
    },
    " ",
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": ["Consider the following questions:"]
    },
    " ",
    {
      "tag": "ul",
      "children": [
        " ",
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "children": ["Is the building residential or commercial?"]
        },
        " ",
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "children": ["How many floors does it have?"]
        },
        " ",
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "children": ["Expected daily elevator usage"]
        },
        " ",
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "children": [
            "Will the elevator transport passengers, goods, or both?"
          ]
        },
        " ",
        {
          "tag": "li",
          "children": ["Are accessibility requirements necessary?"]
        },
        " "
      ]
    },
    " ",
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        "Answering these questions makes it easier to choose the right elevator system."
